/*
  protocol/compute_keyresult.spthy -- thin EFFECT ADAPTER for the agnostic compute behaviour (AGNOSTIC_MASKS.md).
  The core behaviour rules (core/masks/compute_behavior.spthy) put the human's compute response into a
  generic Respond(P,rid,value); this ceremony's CALC_SK step manifests that as KeyResult, which A_send_ack
  / the key-confirmation (msg3_request*) consume. One line, no mask logic -- that lives in core/.
*/

rule Compute_to_KeyResult:
    [ Respond(P, rid, v) ]
  -->
    [ KeyResult(P, rid, v) ]
